= Kevin Zagalo

~~~
{Kevin Zagalo}{img_left}{img/profile.jpeg}{}
Postdoctoral researcher in the [https://team.inria.fr/maracas/ Maracas] team of Inria Lyon. I work under the supervision\n of [http://perso.citi.insa-lyon.fr/jmgorce/ Jean-Marie Gorce] and [https://www.di.ens.fr/baccelli/ François Baccelli]. My research is partially founded by the european\n project ERC NEMO and the french national [https://pepr-futurenetworks.fr/projet/found/ PEPR Future Networks FOUND].

=== Research interests
- Real-time scheduling
- Random wireless networks


